---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shipping Policy — Rakhi Battle by BondBop" noindex>
  <article class="shell legal">
    <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 26 August 2026.</p>
    <p>Rakhi Battle is a BondBop game operated in India by Divya Pandey. Support: <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>No physical shipping</h2>
    <p>We sell digital experiences only. No physical goods are shipped and there are no courier, postal or shipping charges.</p>
    <h2>Digital fulfilment</h2>
    <p>Free results appear after both siblings finish the battle. Paid digital upgrades are delivered through the same private result link immediately after payment is successfully verified.</p>
    <h2>Delivery help</h2>
    <p>If a successful payment is not reflected after refreshing the result page, use the <a href="/contact">support form</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@bondbop.com">support@bondbop.com</a> with the battle code and payment reference. See the full <a href="/delivery">Shipping & Digital Delivery Policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
